                                "sense_id": "360b8cfb-275d-3cb0-a6cf-13704e6c7f90",
                                "text": "Showing that this animal is marsupial, consists of the following characters."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "8e5e6890-be2e-408b-bd55-0b97c421cc9d",
                                "sense_id": "360b8cfb-275d-3cb0-a6cf-13704e6c7f90",
                                "text": "It seemed to me, meandering around Earls Court, that motors should be more marsupial."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "988258e0-8cef-4080-86eb-263f6ad564d5",
                                "sense_id": "360b8cfb-275d-3cb0-a6cf-13704e6c7f90",
                                "text": "But there's this pouch just below my belly button, very marsupial, where the kangaroo lives."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
